  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EBRD &#x2013; UKRAINE STABILISATION AND SUSTAINABLE GROWTH MULTI-DONOR ACCOUNT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In accordance with paragraph 1.04(e) of the General Conditions, it would be the Contributor&#x2019;s preference for the cooperation funds to be utilised by EBRD in support of the following areas: energy sector reform and anti-corruption reform (including in the energy sector) and the Business Ombudsman activity.</narrative>
  </description>
